            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Snippetbar 2.5</h2>
<ul>
  <li>A new welcome window on first launch: enter your license code, then grant Accessibility and Notifications, all in one place.</li>
  <li>The License field in Settings now has a placeholder, and Activate tells you when the field is empty instead of staying greyed out.</li>
  <li>A simpler menu: “Check for updates” has moved into Settings, and Manage snippets stands on its own.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
